Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.83,0:00:15.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Flabébé!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.46,0:00:21.83,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Madatsubomi, \N good morning to you too!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.55,0:00:25.34,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Woo! Poppo!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.38,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,G’morn!{First and last letters of good morning, osu.}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.05,0:00:30.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s... that? A Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.10,0:00:39.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.35,0:00:42.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s a huge balloon!{as in hot-air balloon/blimp. Old dated word, even back in TOS the usual hikousen(airship/blimp) existed. fuusen is also/now the usual word for an everyday balloon, like Fuwante}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.32,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi, I’ve got an errand for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.32,0:00:46.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.49,0:00:51.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,We, the Rising Voltteccers, \N have touched down in Miare City!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.78,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This place’s my hometown, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.78,0:00:58.58,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,And so, lemme give ya \N the Miare City tour!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.62,0:01:02.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Lucario! Loudbone! \N Doesn’t this take you back? {Isn’t this nostalgic?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.63,0:01:07.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow! What a lovely city!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.01,0:01:10.76,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa, and it’s {\i1}full{\i0} of Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.84,0:01:17.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey, you dopes... \N Listen to me, will ya?!
Comment: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.62,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.17,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I’ve been waiting for you two!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.13,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? Ms. Matière{Honorifics note: Matière-san}?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s up with that getup?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah, it’s got detective vibes. {探偵っぽい｡}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.42,0:03:15.26,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Right, Cap?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.80,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Doesn’t it just? Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.80,0:03:21.76,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Still, you sure have grown, Roy!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.68,0:03:26.52,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Oh! And you evolved into Loudbone! \N That’s amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.40,0:03:30.11,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,And Ult... Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.19,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah... I’m back.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.57,0:03:35.90,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yamirami looks well, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.90,0:03:36.82,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,And!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.29,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Whoa! Ult, does that mean...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.08,0:03:46.79,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It came outta the Dark Ball for me! \N Right, Kairyu?{Dread Kairyu}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.71,0:03:51.25,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I see... So you’ve grown too, Ult...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.84,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.21,0:03:57.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You fuss too much. \N It ain’t no big deal!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.34,0:04:01.01,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ms. Matière{Honorifics note: Matière-san}, these two are \N from the Rising Voltteccers...{these two are [their names from their lines] from the RVs}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.26,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m Liko.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,This is Masquernya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’m Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.06,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And this’s Wanival.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.06,0:04:12.32,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I’ve been hoping to meet you. \N I’m Matière.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.03,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,This is Fluff.{mokoo}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.73,0:04:17.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Now, everybody! \N C’mon in and chill!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.53,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.57,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I’ll put on some coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.28,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.74,0:04:26.16,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I just ran out of beans, \N so I sent my assistant out on an errand.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.95,0:04:28.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Errand? Assistant?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.66,0:04:32.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière! I got ‘em for ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.30,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So many Pokémon \N I’ve never seen before!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.35,0:04:43.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.51,0:04:47.23,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And there’s a Kairyu! \N I’ve never seen one before! So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.06,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.85,0:04:52.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Uhh... Are they guests?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.19,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yeah. I told you, didn’t I?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.57,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,These are Ult, Roy, \N and the Rising Voltteccers.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.57,0:04:58.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.86,0:05:01.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Honest Roy and Shy Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.12,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?! What’s {\i1}that{\i0} about?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.12,0:05:05.49,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Oh, she’s...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.49,0:05:06.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière’s assistant.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Handsome House!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.46,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nice to meet you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.96,0:05:15.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So you like Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! Navi {\i1}loves{\i0} Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.72,0:05:25.18,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That smells great... \N Navi wants some, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.18,0:05:28.22,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Remember what I said. \N You aren’t old enough, Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Awww!{buuh! pouting}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.56,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Here! Have some special coffee milk!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.81,0:05:36.27,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s with that? \N It’s basically {\i1}all{\i0} milk.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.27,0:05:37.90,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Perfect for a little kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nyah-nyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Treat someone like a kid, \N and that makes {\i1}you{\i0} the kid. {TL/ALT: If you treat someone like a kid, *you’re* the kid!}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.45,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wha... didja say?!{What was that?! heavily slurred}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Li’l kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.12,0:05:47.45,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Some famous Miare Galettes!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.45,0:05:51.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay! Navi loves these!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.12,0:05:54.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? A group of adventurers? You guys?{[that's what] you all are?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.33,0:05:57.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah, {\i1}adventuring’s{\i} our job.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.42,0:05:58.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Even if you’re a li’l kid?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.55,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.55,0:06:06.10,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We go traveling around the world \N with Pokémon and our friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.10,0:06:09.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,With Pokémon?! Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Does that mean \N you’ve seen all sortsa Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.73,0:06:16.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Obviously! Anywhere we wanna go \N is one quick hop away on the Brave Asagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,“Brave”?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.07,0:06:20.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s our airship.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.19,0:06:22.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! Navi saw it in the morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This huge balloon, like {\i1}bam!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.16,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,And the ship’s captain is Cap.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.91,0:06:31.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?! Mr. Captain?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to go for a ride!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.42,0:06:37.96,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.72,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.72,0:06:43.93,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.43,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,I have a request for a detective.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.18,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.19,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Thank you, miss.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m Navi, the detective’s assistant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.02,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,So, what was your request?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.74,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,I’d like you to look for \N this little one!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.57,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s a Melecie!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.24,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.24,0:07:12.33,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,It’s such a shy, lonely sort,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.33,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,and it’s never run off anywhere \N all by itself before...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.09,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That is concerning. \N How might I identify this Melecie? {How can I identify that Melecie?}{bleh. What distinguishing characteristics does it have?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.96,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,This pendant...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.96,0:07:24.26,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,My husband{Grandpa} gave it to me, \N and this shape...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.97,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Dear Melecie{Honorifics note: Melecie-chan} has \N just the same shape on its chest.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.97,0:07:29.97,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I see... They do look alike.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.76,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Please, do whatever you can!{yoroshiku}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.76,0:07:35.77,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Right! I’m the detective entrusted with \N keeping the peace in Miare, after all! {ENgame: detective who’s been entrusted with the task of protecting the peace of Lumiose City.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.77,0:07:36.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,After all!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.11,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I had some detective work come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.44,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,A search for a Pokémon, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.44,0:07:47.24,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That’s right. I’ll pop back in this evening, \N so if you could look after Navi until...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.11,0:07:50.95,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Please let us help out, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.95,0:07:54.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,If it’s no trouble, we’d like to \N help find the old lady’s Melecie.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’d let us see a detective’s work \N firsthand, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.71,0:08:01.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah! The more the merrier \N when you’re lookin’ for Pokémon, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.50,0:08:06.13,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That’s true... \N Then how about I take you up on your kind offer?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.13,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you very much!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.35,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! \N Miare’s my home turf!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then, you can be \N the assistant’s assistant.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.06,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Lotta attitude comin’ from a little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nyah-nyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.90,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,The old lady’s house is here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.90,0:08:26.28,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,If we go around \N the Rose District, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This’s Navi’s helping!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Your helpings.{Everyone's portions.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.83,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It smells great!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.29,0:08:40.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You gotta have coffee for \N walking around Miare, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.42,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And these’re the Pokémon’s helpings!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Got my detective set all ready too!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s a Dream Ball, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.26,0:08:52.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s right!{Sounano!} Isn’t it cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière gave it me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.39,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,So? What Pokémon ya got?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.77,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Not telling!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.77,0:08:59.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hmph! As if I {\i1}wanted{\i0} to know!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.69,0:09:04.44,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,The two of you that haven’t been \N to Miare before, come with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.73,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,Right, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.73,0:09:09.15,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I’ll go check the plazas with Ult.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.53,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave ‘em to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.53,0:09:11.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.45,0:09:14.49,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,We’ll go and question people.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.83,0:09:17.29,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Keep in contact \N during the search, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.83,0:09:18.95,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.95,0:09:21.25,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Then let’s get investigating!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.21,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.17,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s start with the closest plaza.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.51,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This place’s huge, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.51,0:09:28.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.21,0:09:32.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t you be able to see {\i1}everywhere{\i} \N if you looked from the sky?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.26,0:09:35.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,We’re after a Melecie, ya know? \N It’d be too tiny to see.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.14,0:09:36.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No it wouldn’t!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.97,0:09:37.89,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ta-daah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.89,0:09:42.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m up on rooftops all the time, \N keeping an eye out for all sortsa Pokémon! {I’m always looking out for all sortsa Pokémon from up on rooftops!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.73,0:09:45.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You just wanna ride our ship, don’tcha?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Grrh!{buuh! pouting}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, you’ll let me, right, Roy?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.86,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, I dunno...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.45,0:09:52.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Cap?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.49,0:09:55.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Please! Mr. Captain!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Your cooperation’s appreciated!{notably big words for even kiddier Navi}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.79,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Guess we got no other choice!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.17,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.17,0:10:05.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s contact the Brave Asagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.35,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s proving tough to find...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.35,0:10:20.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The streets all look so similar, \N I feel like I could get lost at this rate...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.93,0:10:26.11,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That’s precisely the kind of trouble that \N detectives help people and Pokémon get out of... {connecting to Liko feeling lost}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.11,0:10:29.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Helping people and Pokémon... \N That’s beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.19,0:10:32.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Melecie is a Pokémon that’s \N born deep underground,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.86,0:10:35.61,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,so perhaps it could’ve gone \N somewhere like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.45,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Underground? A dark place, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.41,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I see, you have a point.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.87,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Then I know just the people to ask.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.25,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,This is the Brave Asagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.05,0:10:55.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.76,0:10:59.60,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Welcome. \N A single loop over the city, was it{right}?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.69,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Nosepass, I’m counting on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.69,0:11:09.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Nosepass?! \N I’ve never seen one before!
Comment: 10,0:11:10.32,0:11:10.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.82,0:11:11.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.48,0:11:13.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Your nose is huge!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.70,0:11:15.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Y-Your nose!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.58,0:11:21.83,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s coffee milk...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.33,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Come on, you can’t \N go scaring people, Metamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Your name’s Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.38,0:11:40.47,Main,Construction worker A,0,0,0,,Well sure, we know plenty about Miare, \N above {\i1}and{\i0} below ground. Comes with the job.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.93,0:11:44.77,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Have you seen any Pokémon \N wandering into any underground facilities?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.56,Main,Construction worker A,0,0,0,,A Melecie, huh...? \N You know anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.36,Main,Construction worker B,0,0,0,,Now you mention it, just earlier...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.36,0:11:52.94,Main,Construction worker B,0,0,0,,I saw this huge dude carrying one \N ‘round the exit of the sewers.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.32,0:11:56.40,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Please, tell me everything you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.53,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s not anywhere...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.53,0:12:03.29,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re about to \N complete the loop around the city.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.46,0:12:08.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Don’t lick that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You can have the rest of Navi’s.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Roy! Where are you right now?!
Comment: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.24,0:12:43.33,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,A big guy with blond hair, \N wearing a martial arts uniform, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.33,0:12:44.91,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Apparently he’s near the sewers.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.91,0:12:46.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.62,0:12:47.83,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Where?! Gimme!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.83,0:12:49.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ack! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.00,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s definitely him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.21,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.13,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s head down!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.55,0:12:55.84,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Look after the ship!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.80,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi, you wait here!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.09,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,We’ll be right back!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.68,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Oho! Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait up! Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.05,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,{\an8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wah! Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.77,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Countin’ on ya, Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Taikaiden!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait up! Navi’s coming, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey! Kairyu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.04,0:13:33.17,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This’s the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.75,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Left down Automne Avenue!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dot, you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.76,0:13:41.76,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Go on... ahead...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.30,0:13:48.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, look. The shape of the rock \N on that Melecie’s chest...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.27,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s the old lady’s Melecie.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.69,0:13:53.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Let’s catch it quick!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.07,0:13:59.44,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Got it. We’ll head straight over there \N as well, so wait up for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.40,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Don’t do anything risky, understood?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.53,0:14:06.62,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.29,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I won’t let you get away.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.29,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.71,0:14:16.79,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I appear to be lost... \N Now, where might I be...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.59,0:14:20.80,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Ohh!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That’s some outrageous brute force...{tondemo, also bakajikara (move name)}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.43,0:14:25.30,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Melecie looks scared...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Do we save it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,No, we have to wait for Ms. Matière{Honorifics note: Matière-san}.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.31,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,But we can’t just sit here talkin’!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.06,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’ve got a point.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.06,0:14:33.98,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.69,0:14:42.19,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.70,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I am aware that you have been following me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.45,0:14:48.78,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.83,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.83,0:14:51.70,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Same to you! \N What’re you playin’ at?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.04,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Strength is power!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.04,0:14:55.71,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Strength is justice!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,“Justice”?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.25,0:14:58.46,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.09,0:15:01.59,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Ooh! What a surprise!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.59,0:15:05.47,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,The Lucario accompanying you... \N Is that not the Yellow Blast?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.34,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yes, but... how did {\i1}you{\i0} know that?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.35,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.35,0:15:13.35,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Miare City once knew a time... \N when rumors spoke of its strength!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.23,0:15:18.81,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I have dreamt of battling it someday!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.90,0:15:22.73,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Allow me to ask... \N What is your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.73,0:15:24.53,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? It’s Roy...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.53,0:15:26.70,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,As for myself, I am Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.70,0:15:27.41,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Mr. Roy{Honorifics note: Roy-san}!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.99,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Please, battle me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.99,0:15:33.83,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Some lessons may only be gained \N by vanquishing strong foes! {ENgame:There are places in life you cannot reach without climbing over strong opponents to get there.}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I want you to hand over \N that little one.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.46,0:15:40.42,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Once our fair and just battle is through, \N I would happily grant any wish you have!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.59,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Got it. Let’s do this, Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.13,0:15:49.47,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,A 1v1 all-out battle! Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.93,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I am counting on you, Tairetsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.94,0:16:03.44,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,{\q2}Tairetsu! Heighten your justice through \N the strength of Mega Evolution, and claim victory!{ENgame:Time to Mega Evolve, Falinks! Justice WILL win the day!}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.69,0:16:09.32,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Strength is power! \N Strength is justice!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.25,0:16:21.84,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Mega Evolve!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The Tairetsu went and combined!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.43,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,This is Mega Tairetsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.06,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’ll do the same!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.15,0:16:44.53,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Gain true power \N and surpass yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.70,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Mega Evolve!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Mega Lucario Z!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.96,0:17:06.96,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Is this, then, the strength of \N the Yellow Blast?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.84,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,We shall demonstrate \N what justice is!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.34,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Tairetsu! Brick Break!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.97,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Fend it off!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.97,0:17:15.81,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Metal Claw!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.18,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Tairetsu! Rock Slide!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.94,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Meet it{move} with Infight!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.24,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Sense it{foe} with Guiding Waves!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.99,0:17:36.74,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Decide this with Iron Head!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.00,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Now! Luster Cannon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.34,0:17:52.01,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,The Yellow Blast... \N Its dexterous movements live up to the rumors.{Dread Lucario}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.01,0:17:54.72,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Yet, if it hopes to collapse \N Tairetsu’s formation...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.22,0:17:56.22,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Its power is lacking!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.81,0:17:59.64,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Tairetsu! Last Stand!{Back-to-the-river formation, fight like you're backed against a river with no more room to concede -> idiomatically 'Last Stand'}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.10,0:18:03.73,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.77,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,And now you shall taste {\i1}this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.77,0:18:06.73,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Use Brick Break!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.29,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.42,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,As expected of the Yellow Blast!{Sasuga. line}{Stock TL, but it fits the character very well.}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.92,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The Tairetsu’s formation is...!{[weakening/etc]!}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.92,0:18:32.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.05,0:18:34.72,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,It is time to claim victory.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.60,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Use another Brick Break, Tairetsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.22,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Lucario, use Turning Swallow Strike!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.48,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Aim for Tairetsu’s belly!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.98,0:18:44.48,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Bear it with your shield!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.48,0:18:48.77,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,A clever stratagem, \N yet lacking in power.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.77,0:18:50.48,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re not through yet! Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.03,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Now, topple them!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.91,0:19:03.37,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,All right!{KO'd Tairetsu: "Ita..."(Ow...)}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.76,0:19:18.39,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Not justice!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.39,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You did it, Roy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.39,0:19:22.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.52,0:19:25.52,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Mr. Roy{Honorifics note: Roy-san}! \N As expected of the Yellow Blast!{Sasuga. line}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.52,0:19:29.61,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,The battle went as the rumors suggested. \N Power alone could not claim victory.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.61,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,The strength to predict \N the flow of battle is also...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.40,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,...justice!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.19,0:19:36.07,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,It was a good lesson.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.45,0:19:38.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’re strong too, Mr. Shirou{Honorifics note: Shirou-san}!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You were both amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Now hand over Melecie, as promised.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.45,0:19:43.50,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.87,0:19:48.88,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Though I must tell you... \N Melecie is not my partner. It is merely lost.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.88,0:19:50.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? And you {\i1}knew{\i0} that?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.88,0:19:52.96,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Roy! Ult! Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.80,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,So, where did you find that Melecie?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.01,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,My younger sister found it \N wandering lost.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.68,0:20:05.14,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Hearing of its plight, \N I myself began to seek its trainer.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.14,0:20:07.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Then ya coulda said so earlier!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We thought it’d been kidnapped...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re sorry for the misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.40,0:20:14.28,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,As am I.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.28,0:20:17.90,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,I forgot myself in the excitement \N of suddenly meeting the Yellow Blast.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.90,0:20:22.83,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I will take responsibility for delivering \N the lost Melecie to its trainer.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.50,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Thank you, detective.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.79,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Well then, everyone... \N May we meet again!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.63,0:20:32.42,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Dear Melecie{Honorifics note: Melecie-chan}!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.13,0:20:37.22,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,While it was lost, \N someone very kind was looking after it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.22,0:20:41.05,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Is that so? \N There was someone like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.35,0:20:45.64,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,My thanks to all of you, too. Merci!{Melecie: mereshii!}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.06,0:20:56.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I told Murdock \N we’d all be staying here tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s gone...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s gone! It’s gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.37,0:21:05.70,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I lost my Dream Ball!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.95,0:21:08.66,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Which Pokémon was inside?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There wasn’t... one...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.71,0:21:12.83,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’d never used it...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.59,0:21:19.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s up with that...? \N So you weren’t even a trainer yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.34,0:21:22.01,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So there wasn’t \N a Pokémon inside it, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.01,0:21:23.35,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Well, that’s a relief!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.76,0:21:24.80,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No, it’s not!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.10,0:21:30.35,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi... There’s nothing we can do. \N I’ll get you a different ball...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.35,0:21:32.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No! I’m gonna look for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.10,0:21:34.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s gotta be {\i1}that{\i0} Dream Ball...{If it's not that Dream Ball,}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.07,0:21:36.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s {\i1}gotta{\i0} be!{it's no good!}
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.75,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.75,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today, it’s Tairetsu!{Different line from usual, every other episode was "今回のお題は[pokemon]"}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.75,0:21:59.76,Main,Friede,0,0,20,,{\q2}It’s a Pokémon that always acts in a pack of six, \N and is constantly changing something when in battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,But do you know what that thing is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.27,0:23:42.23,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.23,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.74,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: Its formation!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.74,0:23:50.12,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,As it fights, it rearranges its formation \N according to how the battle is going!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.37,0:23:55.75,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Okay, we’ll try it too!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.16,0:23:58.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,A new special attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.46,0:24:00.50,Main,Shirou,0,0,0,,Justice!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.21,0:24:03.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aww... Where could it’ve gotten to...?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It was empty inside anyway, yeah? \N Just give up on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No! I’m never giving up!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.47,0:24:10.18,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi, let’s look for it together!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.18,0:24:12.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,With everyone looking, \N I bet we’ll find it!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.35,0:24:14.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s gotta be somewhere in Miare City.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.39,0:24:18.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Guess there ain’t no choice... \N I s’pose I’ll give it a shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.10,0:24:20.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Everybody... thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.98,0:24:24.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.61,0:24:26.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A Dream Ball For You!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.70,0:24:29.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? You’re...!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
